Cc: mark.rutland@arm.com, devicetree@vger.kernel.org, pawel.moll@arm.com, will.deacon@arm.com, virtualization@lists.linux-foundation.org, robh+dt@kernel.org, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
